{"id":"66d3058a6ae62dc5","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-first-order-fibration.md","title":"一阶纤维化","display":"df-first-order-fibration — 一阶纤维化","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-df-first-order-fibration","aliases":["16-df-first-order-fibration","First-order fibration"],"display":"df-first-order-fibration — 一阶纤维化","depends_on":["[[16-df-coherent-fibration]]","[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","[[16-df-simple-quantification]]"],"source":"Definition 4.2.1(iii), p. 233 (PDF 253)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-first-order-fibration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-first-order-fibration</span><span>First-order fibration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-first-order-fibration — 一阶纤维化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e8285984e352a6ff\" href=\"?note=e8285984e352a6ff\" title=\"16-df-coherent-fibration\">16-df-coherent-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 4.2.1(iii), p. 233 (PDF 253)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为纤维化；相关结构分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e8285984e352a6ff\" href=\"?note=e8285984e352a6ff\" title=\"16-df-coherent-fibration\">16-df-coherent-fibration</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CohFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{CohFib}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e8285984e352a6ff\" href=\"?note=e8285984e352a6ff\" title=\"16-df-coherent-fibration\">16-df-coherent-fibration</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOFib}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOFib}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FibCCC}\">\\(\\mathrm{FibCCC}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fe079ae5e294c97a\" href=\"?note=fe079ae5e294c97a\" title=\"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed\">16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimpleProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimpleProd}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e39d17458a2b0aa4\" href=\"?note=e39d17458a2b0aa4\" title=\"16-df-simple-quantification\">16-df-simple-quantification</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FOFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CohFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleProd}(p).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FOFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CohFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleProd}(p).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>纤维指数解释蕴涵，简单积解释全称量词；二者均不可遗漏。</li>\n<li>因为纤维是预序，这里的 CCC 给出 Heyting 预序结构。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 4.2.1(iii), p. 233 (PDF 253)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-coherent-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"e8285984e352a6ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-coherent-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-simple-quantification]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-coherent-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"e8285984e352a6ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；相关结构分别见 [[16-df-coherent-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；相关结构分别见 [[16-df-coherent-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；相关结构分别见 [[16-df-coherent-fibration]]、[[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-simple-quantification]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-coherent-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"e8285984e352a6ff","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CohFib}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-coherent-fibration]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed","status":"resolved","id":"fe079ae5e294c97a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FibCCC}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-fibred-cartesian-closed]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-simple-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"e39d17458a2b0aa4","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{SimpleProd}$ 的定义及结构参数见 [[16-df-simple-quantification]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CohFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOFib}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FibCCC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SimpleProd}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}first\\text{-}order\\text{-}fibration}\\vdash\\quad \\mathrm{FOFib}(p)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CohFib}(p)\\land\\mathrm{FibCCC}(p)\\land\\mathrm{SimpleProd}(p).","display":true}],"bytes":1502,"backlinks":[{"id":"97e1c321780e0cae","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$p$ 为纤维化，$\\mathrm{FOFib}$ 见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]，$\\mathrm{FOFib}^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 为旧拼写。"},{"id":"6ae5978eb27da451","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B$ 为纤维化；一阶结构、CCC、泛对象分别见 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-generic-object]]。"},{"id":"45918fba7ae3214d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOFib}$ 采用 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]，包括预序纤维、纤维有限积/余积、指数、简单等式和简单量词及相应换基条件。"},{"id":"8e14b2a12eb3841f","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"`FOFib` 采用 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]。"},{"id":"f36bc28426b1a7dc","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varphi\\wedge_L\\psi,\\varphi\\vee_L\\psi,\\varphi\\Rightarrow_L\\psi$ 为本页定义的逐点谓词；$\\varphi,\\psi:L\\to\\mathcal P(A)$。$\\mathrm{FOFib}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$、$\\mathrm{SplitTripos}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-split-higher-order-fibration]]。分裂取 $\\kappa_A$，泛对象取 $G_A$；量词的对象作用采用下式，箭头作用取相应预序 Hom 中的唯一箭头。"},{"id":"eeefa02192bbb359","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CCC}$、$\\mathrm{FOFib}$、$\\mathrm{BC}$ 分别采用 [[16-df-ccc-definition]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]。最后一式的论域为 $p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathbf{Set}_{\\mathcal U}$；一般 BC 的可逆性不依赖提升选择。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-function]]、[[16-df-formula]]、[[16-df-provable]]、[[16-df-satisfaction]]、[[16-df-validity-fo]]、[[16-df-type-interpretation]]、[[16-df-general-quantifier]]、[[16-df-beck-chevalley]]、[[16-df-frobenius]]、[[16-df-regular-category]]、[[16-df-coherent-category]]、[[16-df-first-order-fibration]]、[[16-df-higher-order-fibration]]。"},{"id":"26271d2146c7481f","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ 为初等拓扑斯，$\\top:1\\rightarrowtail\\Omega$ 是指定分类子。[[16-df-topos-5]] 的等价与 Corollary5.4.9 保证 $p_{\\rm Sub}$ 是一阶/高阶纤维化；选定其 $\\top_X,\\bot_X,\\wedge_X,\\vee_X,\\Rightarrow_X$ 与沿积投影 $\\Sigma_\\pi,\\Pi_\\pi$ 的伴随。它们均是 [[16-df-first-order-fibration]] 引用的实际纤维结构，未假设待证的语法可靠性。子对象以同构类表示，序为包含。"}],"outgoing":["e8285984e352a6ff","fe079ae5e294c97a","e39d17458a2b0aa4"]}